**Hypothesis:**  
When a cannon is merged onto an existing cannon, the new cannon’s damage becomes the resident cannon’s total damage + the base damage 1 (i.e., damage grows linearly with each merge). Consequently, even if you merge on every round before a pirate reaches position 3, a pirate with 7 HP cannot be killed (total damage = 1 + 2 + 3 = 6 < 7), making the level unwinnable.

